    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681550/extras/d0bde8e9dbdbc84c7bbec3c4da1e73ea.avif?t=1745388591\" data-has-big width=800 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Concepts in early development)<br><br>Take control of a young girl who becomes aware of her emotions. She must manage them well in her journey to investigate the Expanding, an ominous dark cloud taking over her residing space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681550/extras/63ecef1e5870d0125ae4e0ccf7dda8ef.avif?t=1745388591\" data-has-big width=800 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Concepts in early development)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the eerie surroundings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness special powers to overcome obstacles and solve puzzles </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer fears that come in the forms of strange creatures</p></li></ul>",
